  `theorem countably_compact_iff_nested_closed_sets_nonempty_intersection (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] : countably_compact X ↔ ∀ (C : ℕ → Set X), (∀ i, IsClosed (C i)) → (∀ i, (C i).Nonempty) → (∀ i, C (i + 1) ⊆ C i) → (⋂ i, C i).Nonempty := by sorry`
