  `theorem metrizability_of_compact_hausdorff_union_of_metrisable (X : TopologicalSpace) [CompactSpace X] [HausdorffSpace X] (X1 X2 : Set X) [ClosedEmbedding X1 X] [ClosedEmbedding X2 X] [TopologicalSpace X1] [TopologicalSpace X2] [MetricSpace X1] [MetricSpace X2] (hX1X2 : X1 ∪ X2 = Set.univ) : MetricSpace X := by sorry`
  → Good:
  `theorem metrizability_of_compact_hausdorff_union_of_metrizable (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] [CompactSpace X] [T2Space X] (X1 X2 : Set X) (hX1 : IsClosed X1) (hX2 : IsClosed X2) (hcov : X1 ∪ X2 = Set.univ) (h1 : MetrizableSpace X1) (h2 : MetrizableSpace X2) : MetrizableSpace X := by sorry`
